Error [E1803]: Application authority is undecided for `Env`
 Why: This program reads environment variables, and the default for a file with no package block has not allowed that yet.
 Fix: run `jet run --allow=Env Examples/features/effects/authority_undeclared.jet` (or `-A`/`--allow-all` for every effect) to allow it for this run, or declare `allow: [Env]` under `authority` in a leading `package { … }` block of this file (`jet fix --all` inserts it); otherwise approve the exact operation once in an interactive terminal
 Denial: authority
 Scope chain: application default
